---
import CustomLayout from "../layouts/CustomLayout.astro";
---

<CustomLayout
  title="Sur Digital Málaga | Tu Presencia Digital Comienza Aquí | Agencia de Marketing Web Online"
  description="Empieza hoy desde 0€, crea tu presencia online en menos de 7 días. Webs rápidas, modernas y optimizadas."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-white">
    <section
      id="inicio"
      class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900 via-blue-800 to-purple-900 overflow-hidden"
    >
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat opacity-20"
        style='background-image: url("https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=modern%20web%20development%20workspace%20with%20multiple%20monitors%20showing%20website%20designs%2C%20coding%20environment%2C%20professional%20office%20setup%2C%20blue%20and%20purple%20lighting%2C%20technology%20atmosphere&width=1920&height=1080&seq=7&orientation=landscape");'
      >
      </div><div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900/90 to-purple-900/90"
      >
      </div><div
        class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full"
      >
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
          <div class="text-white">
            <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
              Diseño Web que<span
                class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-400"
              >
                Convierte</span
              >
            </h2><p class="text-xl mb-8 text-gray-200 leading-relaxed">
              Creamos páginas web profesionales que no solo se ven increíbles,
              sino que generan resultados reales para tu negocio. Más de 500
              empresas ya confían en nosotros.
            </p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mb-8">
              <a
                href="#contacto"
                class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:from-cyan-600 hover:to-blue-600 transition-all transform hover:scale-105 text-center whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"
                ><i class="ri-rocket-line mr-2"></i>Solicitar Presupuesto</a
              ><a
                href="https://wa.me/34951234567"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="bg-green-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-green-600 transition-all transform hover:scale-105 text-center whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"
                ><i class="ri-whatsapp-line mr-2"></i>WhatsApp</a
              >
            </div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center">
              <div>
                <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-400">500+</div><div
                  class="text-gray-300"
                >
                  Proyectos
                </div>
              </div><div>
                <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-400">98%</div><div
                  class="text-gray-300"
                >
                  Satisfacción
                </div>
              </div><div>
                <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-400">15+</div><div
                  class="text-gray-300"
                >
                  Años
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div><div class="relative">
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <img
                alt="Diseño web profesional"
                class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-2xl"
                src="https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=modern%20website%20mockup%20on%20laptop%20and%20mobile%20devices%2C%20responsive%20web%20design%20showcase%2C%20professional%20business%20website%2C%20clean%20interface%20design%2C%20floating%20devices&width=600&height=500&seq=8&orientation=landscape"
              />
            </div><div
              class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 w-72 h-72 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-500 rounded-full opacity-20 blur-3xl"
            >
            </div><div
              class="absolute -bottom-4 -left-4 w-72 h-72 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 to-pink-500 rounded-full opacity-20 blur-3xl"
            >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section><section id="servicios" class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            Nuestros Servicios
          </h2><p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            Ofrecemos soluciones digitales completas para impulsar tu negocio
            online
          </p>
        </div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div
              class="p-6 rounded-lg cursor-pointer transition-all bg-blue-600 text-white shadow-xl"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
                <div
                  class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4 bg-white/20"
                >
                  <i class="ri-computer-line text-2xl text-white"></i>
                </div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">
                  Diseño Web Profesional
                </h3>
              </div><p class="text-blue-100">
                Creamos páginas web modernas, responsive y optimizadas para
                convertir visitantes en clientes.
              </p>
            </div><div
              class="p-6 rounded-lg cursor-pointer transition-all bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
                <div
                  class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4 bg-blue-100"
                >
                  <i class="ri-shopping-cart-line text-2xl text-blue-600"></i>
                </div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Tiendas Online</h3>
              </div><p class="text-gray-600">
                Desarrollamos ecommerce completos con pasarelas de pago y
                gestión de inventario.
              </p>
            </div><div
              class="p-6 rounded-lg cursor-pointer transition-all bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
                <div
                  class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4 bg-blue-100"
                >
                  <i class="ri-search-line text-2xl text-blue-600"></i>
                </div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Posicionamiento SEO</h3>
              </div><p class="text-gray-600">
                Mejoramos tu visibilidad en Google para atraer más clientes
                potenciales.
              </p>
            </div><div
              class="p-6 rounded-lg cursor-pointer transition-all bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
                <div
                  class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4 bg-blue-100"
                >
                  <i class="ri-megaphone-line text-2xl text-blue-600"></i>
                </div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Marketing Digital</h3>
              </div><p class="text-gray-600">
                Estrategias completas de marketing online para hacer crecer tu
                negocio.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-xl p-8">
            <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
              <div
                class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4"
              >
                <i class="ri-computer-line text-3xl text-blue-600"></i>
              </div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                Diseño Web Profesional
              </h3>
            </div><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
              Creamos páginas web modernas, responsive y optimizadas para
              convertir visitantes en clientes.
            </p><ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-center">
                <i class="ri-check-line text-green-500 mr-3"></i><span
                  class="text-gray-700">Diseño responsive</span
                >
              </li><li class="flex items-center">
                <i class="ri-check-line text-green-500 mr-3"></i><span
                  class="text-gray-700">Optimización SEO</span
                >
              </li><li class="flex items-center">
                <i class="ri-check-line text-green-500 mr-3"></i><span
                  class="text-gray-700">Carga rápida</span
                >
              </li><li class="flex items-center">
                <i class="ri-check-line text-green-500 mr-3"></i><span
                  class="text-gray-700">Panel de administración</span
                >
              </li>
            </ul><button
              class="mt-6 bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"
              >Solicitar Información</button
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="contacto" class="py-20 bg-blue-900">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
          <div class="text-white">
            <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">
              ¿Listo para Impulsar tu Negocio?
            </h2><p class="text-xl text-blue-100 mb-8">
              Contacta con nosotros y descubre cómo podemos ayudarte a alcanzar
              tus objetivos digitales.
            </p><div class="space-y-6">
              <div class="flex items-center">
                <div
                  class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-700 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4"
                >
                  <i class="ri-phone-line text-xl text-white"></i>
                </div><div>
                  <div class="font-semibold">Teléfono</div><div
                    class="text-blue-200"
                  >
                    +34 951 234 567
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div class="flex items-center">
                <div
                  class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-700 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4"
                >
                  <i class="ri-mail-line text-xl text-white"></i>
                </div><div>
                  <div class="font-semibold">Email</div><div
                    class="text-blue-200"
                  >
                    info@webmasterpro.es
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div class="flex items-center">
                <div
                  class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-700 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mr-4"
                >
                  <i class="ri-map-pin-line text-xl text-white"></i>
                </div><div>
                  <div class="font-semibold">Dirección</div><div
                    class="text-blue-200"
                  >
                    Calle Larios 15, 29005 Málaga
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</CustomLayout>
